BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART:20261025T150000Z
DTEND:20261025T210000Z
UID:7ekuu1pbnv5glh299dusjl1mkk@google.com
DESCRIPTION:<p>Doors at 11\, Product Will be Handed out at Noon Sharp.</p><p>Players will participate in an ordinary three-pack pick-two booster draft\, with one major shake-up: Before each game begins\, a player may reveal two different cards they drafted that are part of an Echoed Pair. Those cards start the game in exile. The player may cast one of those cards during the game as though it were in their hand\; when they do\, they may shuffle the other into their library. Players begin each game with only a single Echoed Pair in exile.</p><p>Prize Support: One Reality Fracture Play Booster per Round Win\, with some bonus promos.</p>
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Reality Echoes Pick Two Draft
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
