BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART:20261017T150000Z
DTEND:20261017T220000Z
UID:1beja8kqoo78scda16t84v03ja@google.com
DESCRIPTION:<p>11th is here\, Armageddon rages\, and there is only WAR! Bring your mightiest warriors to this inaugural tournament in our new location\, celebrating both the new edition and new digs!</p><p></p><p>1000pt army per player\, all models must follow standard tournament conversion rules and be fully assembled. We will be using 26-27 Mission Decks and Tournament Companion Missions based on force dispositions. Time will be allotted at the start of each round for mission set up with 1:30 round clocks.</p><p>Doors at 10:30am\, dice roll at 11am sharp! $10 Entry\, official OP tournament prizes for Best General and participation. Additional prizes for Best Painted Model and Best Sportsman.</p><p></p><p>Max 10 players\, 3 round event with a break for lunch.</p><p></p><p>Paint Event: We will be judging submissions for best painted HQ. Showcase your leader in the new era with technique\, creativity\, and style. Standard competition rules apply: all submissions must be majority (~70%) a GW model\, fully painted and based by the submitter\, judged by staff\, and do not need to be models played in the tournament that day\, nor even of your played faction.</p><p></p><p>No refunds on event entry.</p>
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:40k 11th Edition Tournament - 1000k
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
